{"id":"folie","lemma":"folie","pos":"noun","rank":1175,"glosses":["madness, folly, insanity; silliness, craziness","folly"],"ipa":"/fɔ.li/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8a/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-0x010C-folie.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-0x010C-folie.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"folies"},"formAudio":{"folies":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3b/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-0x010C-folies.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"L'amour est une folie.","en":"Love is crazy.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"love"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Ne faites pas de folies.","en":"Don't do anything crazy.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"C'est la folie.","en":"This is insanity.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Ce serait de la folie de recommencer.","en":"It would be crazy to do that again.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,null,null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to restart"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"of the"]]},{"text":"Nous n'avons pas besoin de faire des folies.","en":"We don't need to splurge.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"need"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]}]}